    <about-section-title><![CDATA[<span class="section-num">01.</span> About Me]]></about-section-title>

    <about-intro><![CDATA[
      Hi, my name is <a class="pretty-a" href="#" style="font-family: Minecraft; font-size: 24px">Maploop</a><br>
      ...and I enjoy creating things that live on the internet. <br> <br>
      I have extensive experience with Minecraft development and building large-scale multiplayer experiences, including an open source Hypixel SkyBlock recreation that has gained hundreds of stars on GitHub.
      <br> <br>
      My journey in software development began back in late 2019, when I decided I wanted to make my own Minecraft plugin for the first time. Since then, I've had the opportunity to
      <a href="https://discord.gg/atlasmc" class="pretty-a">manage my own dev team of over 10</a>, <br>
      <a href="https://trexmine.com" class="pretty-a">work for the largest Minecraft server in Iran</a>, <br>
      <a href="https://github.com/maploop" class="pretty-a">deliver over 50 freelance projects</a> and <br>
      <a href="https://discord.gg/atlasmc" class="pretty-a">Lead the largest community-driven re-creation of Hypixel SkyBlock at Atlas Network</a>. <br>
      <br>
      I have also recently worked on a variety of <a class="pretty-a" href="#slide-1">Open Source Projects</a>.
      <br>
      <br>
      <button onclick="window.open('https://github.com/Maploop')" class="cool-btn">Visit my GitHub</button>
    ]]></about-intro>

